    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67534" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήρ-ῡμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is drawn out: strand</i> of gut, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				65.33
			</span></i>; <i>skein</i> of such strands, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				81.14
			</span></i>; <i>thread</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηρύματα λίθων</span>, of
			fibrous stone, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.434a
			</span></i>; of bitumen, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.8.4
			</span></i>; of ship's cordage, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cic.</u>
				47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἐρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dem.Ophth.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.53
			</span></i>; <i>kink</i> in a string, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a serpent's
				<i>coil</i> or <i>trail</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολιχῷ μ. γαστρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					160
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				265
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηρύγματι</span> codd., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cyr.
			</span></i>).</div>
